From: Enceka <enceka@yeah.net>
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: mt76: retain exposed CT WED DMA owners until reboot

Pin the radio module and DMA capsule before the first WED exposure.
Keep both hardware objects, rings, token payloads and provider leases
after a stop or probe failure. Park software producers and consumers,
withdraw wireless registration, and let PCI devres expire only after
installing persistent offline bus operations. Keep activation gated.

